(There is something written by hand on the other side)

<font="Biro_Script_reduced SDF">I'm sorry old friend, but I couldn't cut it this time. The higher ups said that all the funds are being directed to defense and rebuilding (at least partly lies, I think many of them are funneling money to themselves). 

There is a new invention, a mechanical ventilator that's being tested right now that could help keep Orianna's lungs functioning. They're very expensive, and it might take a few years to use it, and we'd need to run some tests. But keep going with the blood, spinal fluid and brain function research, it might prove useful. 

Besides that, keep close to her. She could still hear you.

From

Klaus</font>